            <chunk name="Object" index="42">
              <items count="2">
                <item name="GUID" type_name="gh_guid" type_code="9">c9b2d725-6f87-4b07-af90-bd9aefef68eb</item>
                <item name="Name" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Tekton Display</item>
              </items>
              <chunks count="1">
                <chunk name="Container">
                  <items count="15">
                    <item name="Description" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">The analysis model as a picture: elements as their sections, connections highlighted (rigid links dark, couplings magenta with white hinge spheres), supports as engineering symbols by condition (pyramid on a plate = pinned, rollers = free direction, ball, block = fixed) with a label, loads as arrows scaled by value, moments as rings, reactions in blue once results exist. Member geometry (beams, plates) on a toggle, drawn semi-transparent. Vertex-coloured meshes - no Custom Preview needed. The presentation view; Tekton Inspect is the bare debug view.</item>
                    <item name="GraftStandardOutputLines" type_name="gh_bool" type_code="1">true</item>
                    <item name="IconOverride" type_name="gh_drawing_bitmap" type_code="37">
                      <bitmap length="455"></bitmap>
                    </item>
                    <item name="InstanceGuid" type_name="gh_guid" type_code="9">00e328de-4228-49e3-af7a-1a47c8854e10</item>
